Third-party dataset attribution
===============================

The number, Chinese name, pinyin, and common English title fields in
data/hexagrams.json are adapted from:

  FENGTING2025/iching-64-hexagrams-json
  https://github.com/FENGTING2025/iching-64-hexagrams-json

The upstream dataset is distributed under the MIT License. Its README states
that attribution is appreciated but not required. Retrieval descriptions,
universal cue mappings, model code, and synthetic dream records in this
repository are newly authored for this project.
